+## Watching the server
+
+`GET /admin/platform/health` (platform administrators) says why the server is or is not healthy:
+database and schema revision, free disk space, the run queue, the version, run isolation and the
+periodic jobs. `GET /metrics` serves the same figures in the Prometheus text format to a scraper
+that sends `WORKPILOT_METRICS_TOKEN`, and with `AUTO_CLAUDE_OTEL_ENDPOINT` each request becomes an
+OpenTelemetry span named after its route. None of them names a person, a project or a path.
+
